<section class="section section--hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">
      <span data-lang="en">AI safety research · May 2026</span>
      <span data-lang="es">Investigación en seguridad de IA · mayo 2026</span>
    </span>
    <h1>
      <span data-lang="en">
        The <span style="color: var(--amber-500); font-style: italic;">democratization</span> paradox:
        <br />
        are the most accessible models the most dangerous?
      </span>
      <span data-lang="es">
        La paradoja de la <span style="color: var(--amber-500); font-style: italic;">democratización</span>:
        <br />
        ¿los modelos más accesibles son los más peligrosos?
      </span>
    </h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top: var(--space-8); color: var(--text-secondary);">
      <span data-lang="en">
        An AI model that runs on a phone. No safety filter. Speaking 140 languages.
        Uploaded to the internet <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">48 hours</strong> after release.
        This research asks: how broken is that filter in each language? And do smaller models break more than larger ones?
      </span>
      <span data-lang="es">
        Un modelo de IA que corre en un celular. Sin filtro. Hablando 140 idiomas.
        Subido a internet <strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">48 horas</strong> después del lanzamiento oficial.
        Esta investigación pregunta: ¿qué tan roto está ese filtro en cada idioma? ¿Y los modelos más chicos se rompen más que los grandes?
      </span>
    </p>

    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a href="/blog-post" class="hero__cta-primary">
        <span data-lang="en">Read the full blog post</span>
        <span data-lang="es">Leer el blog post completo</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="/talk" class="hero__cta-secondary">
        <span data-lang="en">Watch the 6-min talk</span>
        <span data-lang="es">Ver la charla de 6 min</span>
        <span class="hero__cta-tag">ES</span>
      </a>
      <span class="hero__cta-meta">
        <span data-lang="en">~15 min read · results, methods and limitations</span>
        <span data-lang="es">~15 min de lectura · resultados, métodos y limitaciones</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-hint">
      <span>
        <span data-lang="en">or keep reading the summary</span>
        <span data-lang="es">o seguí leyendo el resumen</span>
      </span>
      <span class="scroll-hint__arrow">↓</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-10, 40px);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3, 12px) var(--space-4, 16px);
  }

  .hero__cta-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3, 12px);
    padding: 12px 22px;
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--bg-base);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 120ms ease, opacity 120ms ease;
  }

  .hero__cta-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .hero__cta-primary svg {
    transition: transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .hero__cta-primary:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }

  .hero__cta-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2, 8px);
    padding: 11px 18px;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 120ms ease, border-color 120ms ease;
  }

  .hero__cta-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .hero__cta-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--surface-3);
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .hero__cta-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    flex-basis: 100%;
